---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About John Rick Manzanares, a Filipino mathematician and computational researcher.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1>Becoming, always.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      “Banyuhay” means metamorphosis or transformation. The word has stayed with me because my path
      through mathematics has repeatedly changed form while keeping the same underlying curiosity.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <img class="portrait" src="/assets/JohnRick.jpg" alt="Portrait of John Rick Manzanares" loading="lazy" />
      <div>
        <p>
          I am John Rick Manzanares, a Filipino mathematician and computational researcher from
          Baguio City in the northern Philippines. I studied mathematics at the University of the
          Philippines Baguio after attending Philippine Science High School – Cordillera Administrative Region Campus.
        </p>
        <p>
          My early interests were closer to differential geometry, but my research direction changed
          after I encountered topological data analysis. My master’s work studied homology-based
          centrality, and later projects brought topology into electrocardiogram classification,
          computer vision, and scientific data analysis.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am now a Marie Skłodowska-Curie doctoral fellow working in Poland. My doctoral research
          focuses on mathematical and computational descriptions of bone microstructure, combining
          topological data analysis, computational geometry, scientific computing, and machine learning.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also care about teaching and open research software. I like mathematical explanations
          that define their objects carefully, code that can be reviewed rather than treated as a black box,
          and tools that remain useful beyond a single experiment.
        </p>

        <ul class="fact-list">
          <li><strong>Research</strong><span>Topology, geometry, scientific computing, machine learning</span></li>
          <li><strong>Current focus</strong><span>Bone microstructure and computational descriptors</span></li>
          <li><strong>From</strong><span>Baguio City, Philippines</span></li>
          <li><strong>Based in</strong><span>Poland</span></li>
          <li><strong>Code</strong><span>Python, Rust, Julia, R, and the occasional language required by the problem</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="mailto:jdolormanzanares@impan.pl">Email me</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/jhnrckmnznrs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
